+
+| Suite | Checked | Failures |
+|---|---:|---:|
+| canary (10 injected bugs) | 10 | 0 |
+| overflow (pages × widths) | 1,940 | 0 |
+| header (layouts 320 → 1440, every pixel × 5 languages) | 5,605 | 0 |
