+| Sweep | Text boxes measured | Below AA before the fixes | Below AA now |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|
+| Dark theme · 8 Arabic pages at 1280 × 900 | 1,435 | 10 findings / 6 distinct types (worst 1.09:1) | **0** |
